RRULE:FREQ=MONTHLY;BYDAY=2SA;UNTIL=20311214T035959Z
SUMMARY:2nd Saturday Open Mic
LOCATION:Montague Common Hall\, 34 Main St\, Montague\, MA 01351
DESCRIPTION:Monthly open mic\, usually the 2nd Saturday of the month. Doors
  and performer sign-ups start at 6:15. All types of performers welcome: mu
 sicians\, poets\, singers\, dancers\, storytellers. Names are drawn for a 
 random order\; expect 2–4 songs (10–15 minutes) depending on turnout. 
 BYO food and beverage. Voluntary donations.\nhttps://www.facebook.com/mont
 agueCommonHallOpenMic/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:mch-old-25344@montaguecommonhall.org
