RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY;BYDAY=TU;UNTIL=20261230T035959Z
SUMMARY:Community Yoga
LOCATION:Montague Common Hall\, 34 Main St\, Montague\, MA 01351
DESCRIPTION:Heart-centered yoga. All levels of experience welcome. Sliding 
 scale $7–$20\; no one will be turned away for lack of funds.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:mch-old-25317@montaguecommonhall.org
DTSTAMP:20261025T152115Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261009T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261009T213000
RRULE:FREQ=MONTHLY;BYDAY=2FR;UNTIL=20270612T035959Z
SUMMARY:Montague Square Dance!
LOCATION:Montague Common Hall\, 34 Main St\, Montague\, MA 01351
DESCRIPTION:Square dances with a live band and a guest caller every month. 
 All dances are taught. 6:30–8 are simpler dances great for beginners\, f
 amilies\, and kids\; after 8 they get more complex\, but everyone is still
  welcome. Bring clean\, non-marking shoes and a water bottle. Suggested do
 nation $7–$20.\nQuestions: montaguesquaredance@gmail.com\nhttps://www.fa
 cebook.com/profile.php?id=100038849593692
END:VEVENT
