SUMMARY:Montague Swing Dance
LOCATION:Montague Common Hall\, 34 Main St\, Montague\, MA 01351
DESCRIPTION:Come dance the night away at this winter solstice event! A soci
 al swing dance with live music from the Butterfly Swing Band\, 7–9 pm. B
 eginners and experienced dancers all welcome. Cozy winter treats provided\
 ; special outfits and costumes encouraged. Sliding scale $5–$35 to suppo
 rt the band and the Common Hall.
END:VEVENT
